# Gofile — Go binaries installed via `go install`.
# Entries are full module paths (NOT bare binary names), optionally pinned
# with `@<version>` (e.g. example.com/cmd/tool@v1.2.0-RC1). Unpinned entries
# track @latest — which never resolves to a prerelease, so RCs must be pinned.
# Synced by `system-package go sync`. Strict cleanup: removing a
# line uninstalls the binary on next sync.

# troupe — the TUI widget toolkit (troupe consolidation, spec 2026-08-17):
# the input:: shims (`troupe input`), the standalone dialog verbs
# (confirm/line/text/choose/form), the jobs dashboard, the pickers' float
# frame (`troupe frame`, the pty-frame port), and the scrub timeline pane
# (`troupe timeline`, the tm-timeline port) — one binary for all of it.
github.com/Townk/troupe/cmd/troupe@v0.2.2

# ai-playbook — the AI terminal assistant (docked pager, diff viewer,
# playbook drive; installs the short `apb` alias too via cmd/apb). RC4 is
# the troupe-consolidation release: its dialog widgets come from troupe
# and `cmd/ask` no longer exists upstream (strict cleanup already
# uninstalled the binary here).
github.com/Townk/ai-playbook/cmd/ai-playbook@v1.0.0-RC4
github.com/Townk/ai-playbook/cmd/apb@v1.0.0-RC4

